    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise of Adou</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Multi-Ending Character-Raising Game</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is a multi-ending raising simulation game. You will personally guide and nurture Adou, interact with legendary generals of Shu Han, fight alongside new companions, and lead him toward different fates\u2014rewriting the ending of Shu Han itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/763834c8da9dee2f710cc0fc8af4a5e9.avif?t=1750422748\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studying boosts many of Adou\u2019s attributes, but it also increases stress and darkness. Will you push him hard for excellence, or give him a joyful, carefree childhood? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main types of endings: <strong>Career Endings</strong> and <strong>Romantic Endings</strong>. Based on Adou\u2019s final attributes, you can unlock different career paths\u2014even the chance to unify the Three Kingdoms. Meanwhile, five characters are romanceable, each offering a unique romantic conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/c31a3e1991d8273011c7c179a80a0aac.avif?t=1750422748\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/7538b09e4dd922121dbd597b94346f4c.avif?t=1750422748\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple growth paths and a wide variety of <strong>mini-games</strong>, including puzzles, log striking, card matching, trivia quizzes, archery, guqin playing, arithmetic, and more. Each mini-game enhances different stats. Help Adou grow through every challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/3aecbd3807e258f1d6950f2dbd81236d.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic <strong>turn-based combat</strong> and grow together with your companions. Each character has a unique combat style. With a six-person team, you can form countless formations\u2014adapt to different enemies with smart tactics to unleash powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/d5980c3e432e98df9cac52363015cbe7.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your companions, build bonds over time, and grow alongside them. These relationships will become Adou\u2019s strength on the road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/bc12531fa511db67257526dc170d1e7e.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is the developer\u2019s first game, born from both a sense of regret and imagination about the fall of Shu Han. While making this game, the developer studied history, learned tools, and slowly \u201craised\u201d Adou. Though the journey wasn\u2019t easy, it was deeply meaningful. We hope this game brings you joy\u2014even if just for a brief, memorable moment.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise of Adou</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Multi-Ending Character-Raising Game</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is a multi-ending raising simulation game. You will personally guide and nurture Adou, interact with legendary generals of Shu Han, fight alongside new companions, and lead him toward different fates\u2014rewriting the ending of Shu Han itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/763834c8da9dee2f710cc0fc8af4a5e9.avif?t=1750422748\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studying boosts many of Adou\u2019s attributes, but it also increases stress and darkness. Will you push him hard for excellence, or give him a joyful, carefree childhood? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main types of endings: <strong>Career Endings</strong> and <strong>Romantic Endings</strong>. Based on Adou\u2019s final attributes, you can unlock different career paths\u2014even the chance to unify the Three Kingdoms. Meanwhile, five characters are romanceable, each offering a unique romantic conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/c31a3e1991d8273011c7c179a80a0aac.avif?t=1750422748\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/7538b09e4dd922121dbd597b94346f4c.avif?t=1750422748\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple growth paths and a wide variety of <strong>mini-games</strong>, including puzzles, log striking, card matching, trivia quizzes, archery, guqin playing, arithmetic, and more. Each mini-game enhances different stats. Help Adou grow through every challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/3aecbd3807e258f1d6950f2dbd81236d.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic <strong>turn-based combat</strong> and grow together with your companions. Each character has a unique combat style. With a six-person team, you can form countless formations\u2014adapt to different enemies with smart tactics to unleash powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/d5980c3e432e98df9cac52363015cbe7.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your companions, build bonds over time, and grow alongside them. These relationships will become Adou\u2019s strength on the road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/bc12531fa511db67257526dc170d1e7e.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is the developer\u2019s first game, born from both a sense of regret and imagination about the fall of Shu Han. While making this game, the developer studied history, learned tools, and slowly \u201craised\u201d Adou. Though the journey wasn\u2019t easy, it was deeply meaningful. We hope this game brings you joy\u2014even if just for a brief, memorable moment.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Rise of A'dou&quot; is a multi-ending life simulation game. Rewrite history by raising A'dou into a true ruler. Rally companions, forge bonds, and create a new future for Shu Han in an unforgettable era of the Three Kingdoms.",
